   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Ah, thank you for the quick reply. The data was simulated, so I had not examined the actual response patterns. It does seem like the number of placeholders correspond to the number of responses that were given for each question. That answered my question. Thank you again for the quick reply, and for a great and elegant IRT package!</div>"
    ],
    [
